    interview: '''Interview preparation: Define vehicle and plant exhaust emissions in your own words; identify the applicable permit or approved plan; explain the source–pathway–receptor relationship; describe prevention, monitoring, documentation and escalation steps; and give a site example. A strong answer distinguishes verified legal obligations from project controls and explains how effectiveness is checked.''',
